ment()\nlm_norm_aug %>% gf_point(.resid ~ .fitted)\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n![](corr-lm-explorations_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-2-1.png){width=2100}\n:::\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nlm_norm_aug %>%\n  gf_qq(~.resid) %>%\n  gf_qqline()\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n![](corr-lm-explorations_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-2-2.png){width=2100}\n:::\n:::\n\n\n### Uniform Errors\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nlm_unif_aug <- lm(yu ~ x, data = data) %>%\n  augment()\nlm_unif_aug %>% gf_point(.resid ~ .fitted)\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n![](corr-lm-explorations_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-3-1.png){width=2100}\n:::\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nlm_unif_aug %>%\n  gf_qq(~.resid, distribution = stats::qnorm) %>%\n  gf_qqline()\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n![](corr-lm-explorations_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-3-2.png){width=2100}\n:::\n:::\n\n\n### Negative Binom Errors\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nlm_nbinom_aug <- lm(yb ~ x, data = data) %>%\n  augment()\nlm_nbinom_aug %>% gf_point(.resid ~ .fitted)\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n![](corr-lm-explorations_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-4-1.png){width=2100}\n:::\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nlm_nbinom_aug %>%\n  gf_qq(~.resid, distribution = stats::qnorm) %>%\n  gf_qqline()\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n![](corr-lm-explorations_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-4-2.png){width=2100}\n:::\n:::\n\n\n### Gamma Errors\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nlm_gamm_aug <- lm(yg ~ x, data = data) %>%\n  augment()\nlm_gamm_aug %>% gf_point(.resid ~ .fitted)\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n![](corr-lm-explorations_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-5-1.png){width=2100}\n:::\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nlm_gamm_aug %>%\n  gf_qq(~.resid, distribution = stats::qnorm) %>%\n  gf_qqline()\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n![](corr-lm-explorations_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-5-2.png){width=2100}\n:::\n:::\n\n",
